# raw corpus snapshot, record format v1
# Lines beginning with '#' are comments and are never part of a record.
# Blank lines are ignored. A record is terminated by a bare '@end' directive.
# This file is hand-authored task substrate. It is not generated.

@id d001
@lang en
@title Tidal flats of the estuary
@body The estuary drains twice a day.
+body Waders follow the retreating water.
@end

